🔧 Fine-Tuning (Important Concept)

Fine-tuning means:

```text id="r5w8yz"
Adapting a pre-trained model to a specific task
```

Example:

* Train BERT on your custom dataset

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📊 Pre-trained vs Training from Scratch

| Feature       | Pre-trained Model | From Scratch |
| ------------- | ----------------- | ------------ |
| Time          | Low               | High         |
| Data Required | Less              | Huge         |
| Performance   | High              | Depends      |
| Complexity    | Easy              | Difficult    |

